OL,5,G0200 Sleeping with My Murderer
OL,6,     FWithin two years of meeting
OL,7,     FCordelia Farrell, Wayne Coventry
OL,8,     Fdials 999, pleading for help.
OL,9,     FDespite warnings of friends and
OL,10,     Ffamily, he stays with her - a
OL,11,     Fdecision that will cost him dear.
